(6747583, 1010892, 99263, '<td valign="top">Hmmm....Squirrels....Wendy?....very funny and well done :) Very convincing melting effect and flames. Having looked at all the entries now I think you will take the third place and yellow ribbon with this one. An 8 from me.<br/> <br/>I just tried to identify the two images on the left hand side of the monitor by comparing them to the images in the challenges still running but i don''t see them in there. Odd...The bottom image of the two should be your entry in the "Grunge" challenge of which the results are now known but i can''t find it in there either. Very strange....what trickery is this?<br/>I don''t think it''s Wendy anymore as i just checked through Wendy''s portfolio and can''t find those two images in there either. Also Wendy''s entry in the "Grunge" challenge is not the bottom image visible on the left of the monitor.<br/>But of course it''s also possible that you photo shopped 2 other images in there knowing some folks would try to identify them and link them to you. Big mystery anyway :)<br/> <br/>PS. You may PM me with the explanation. I have already voted so that won''t change anything.</td>', 'Hmmm....Squirrels....Wendy?....very funny and well done :) Very convincing melting effect and flames. Having looked at all the entries now I think you will take the third place and yellow ribbon with this one. An 8 from me. I just tried to identify the two images on the left hand side of the monitor by comparing them to the images in the challenges still running but i don''t see them in there. Odd...The bottom image of the two should be your entry in the "Grunge" challenge of which the results are now known but i can''t find it in there either. Very strange....what trickery is this?I don''t think it''s Wendy anymore as i just checked through Wendy''s portfolio and can''t find those two images in there either. Also Wendy''s entry in the "Grunge" challenge is not the bottom image visible on the left of the monitor.But of course it''s also possible that you photo shopped 2 other images in there knowing some folks would try to identify them and link them to you. Big mystery anyway :) PS. You may PM me with the explanation. I have already voted so that won''t change anything.', '2012-04-20 18:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
