(6748688, 1010936, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a tough image to comment on because I''m not a huge fan of soft focus imagery. This in particular looks rather flat and dull- there isn''t any dimensionality to the image that you would normally get using this technique. Perhaps a bit of color against the deep black would have been helpful.</td>', 'This is a tough image to comment on because I''m not a huge fan of soft focus imagery. This in particular looks rather flat and dull- there isn''t any dimensionality to the image that you would normally get using this technique. Perhaps a bit of color against the deep black would have been helpful.', '2012-04-22 10:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748691, 1010935, 101256, '<td valign="top">Being a former vollie myself, I appreciate the sentiment here. I really like the tough of color on the Caduceus - nice touch.  Well done.</td>', 'Being a former vollie myself, I appreciate the sentiment here. I really like the tough of color on the Caduceus - nice touch.  Well done.', '2012-04-22 10:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748700, 1010898, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like this for some reason but I''m not at all sure why.  I think it might be the black with the gray background.</td>', 'I like this for some reason but I''m not at all sure why.  I think it might be the black with the gray background.', '2012-04-22 11:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748704, 1010828, 101256, '<td valign="top">Had to laugh at this.  Been there, done that. Nice whimsical image. Well done.</td>', 'Had to laugh at this.  Been there, done that. Nice whimsical image. Well done.', '2012-04-22 11:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748730, 1010877, 101256, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on "emergency", but it doesn''t work for me. Still, the image is attractive from a technical standpoint - interesting use of white space.</td>', 'Interesting take on "emergency", but it doesn''t work for me. Still, the image is attractive from a technical standpoint - interesting use of white space.', '2012-04-22 12:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748733, 1010819, 101256, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion you understand, but I think this might have worked better if the "victim" wasn''t looking down at the banana peel.  And as it happens, I have actually fallen flat on my wazoo slipping on a banana peel - it was a piece of banana peel, but still.  Nice image - crisp, sharp, color is excellent and I like the lighting a lot.  Nice job.</td>', 'Just my opinion you understand, but I think this might have worked better if the "victim" wasn''t looking down at the banana peel.  And as it happens, I have actually fallen flat on my wazoo slipping on a banana peel - it was a piece of banana peel, but still.  Nice image - crisp, sharp, color is excellent and I like the lighting a lot.  Nice job.', '2012-04-22 12:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748734, 1010892, 101256, '<td valign="top">I laughed out loud when I saw this - very clever and a really nice job of editing. Should place in the top five. No technical issues to speak of. Well done.</td>', 'I laughed out loud when I saw this - very clever and a really nice job of editing. Should place in the top five. No technical issues to speak of. Well done.', '2012-04-22 12:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748735, 1010938, 101256, '<td valign="top">An impressive piece of editing, but I think it''s a little over done - no pun intended. To me, it would have worked better if the branch was cropped out leaving just the kids and the fire. At least it looks that way to me on my monitor.  Well done - should place in the top ten at a minimum.</td>', 'An impressive piece of editing, but I think it''s a little over done - no pun intended. To me, it would have worked better if the branch was cropped out leaving just the kids and the fire. At least it looks that way to me on my monitor.  Well done - should place in the top ten at a minimum.', '2012-04-22 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748737, 1010921, 101256, '<td valign="top">I really like the little touches of color and the rather bleak drab surround. Nothing really to nit pick as technically it is an excellent image. Top ten I would guess.  Nice job.</td>', 'I really like the little touches of color and the rather bleak drab surround. Nothing really to nit pick as technically it is an excellent image. Top ten I would guess.  Nice job.', '2012-04-22 12:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748739, 1010489, 101256, '<td valign="top">Not to be overly critical, but there is too much space surrounding the subject - I had to look for a second to see the overturning pram. A closer look would have worked better, then this is a capture of the moment and we all can''t get that close to any rapidly occurring event.</td>', 'Not to be overly critical, but there is too much space surrounding the subject - I had to look for a second to see the overturning pram. A closer look would have worked better, then this is a capture of the moment and we all can''t get that close to any rapidly occurring event.', '2012-04-22 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748740, 1010972, 101256, '<td valign="top">To me, the fire is a little vague ad not well defined as most fires are.  I like the use of the Lego choppers.  A good effort, it isn''t as good by comparison as some others.</td>', 'To me, the fire is a little vague ad not well defined as most fires are.  I like the use of the Lego choppers.  A good effort, it isn''t as good by comparison as some others.', '2012-04-22 12:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748741, 1010197, 101256, '<td valign="top">I have two opposing opinions on this.  The first is that this image is way too dark to be truly effective. On the other hand it adds some mystery and drama to the image. So I''m going to split the difference and rate it a seven.</td>', 'I have two opposing opinions on this.  The first is that this image is way too dark to be truly effective. On the other hand it adds some mystery and drama to the image. So I''m going to split the difference and rate it a seven.', '2012-04-22 12:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748742, 1010836, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like it, very good piece of editing and the humor is perfect. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like it, very good piece of editing and the humor is perfect. Nicely done.', '2012-04-22 12:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748743, 1010939, 101256, '<td valign="top">Enjoy the humor of this. A little over dark I think - could have used a little more contrast instead the gray overtone. Still, pretty clever and funny.  Love the guy in the background and the light hitting the model''s hand at the rear table - nice touch.</td>', 'Enjoy the humor of this. A little over dark I think - could have used a little more contrast instead the gray overtone. Still, pretty clever and funny.  Love the guy in the background and the light hitting the model''s hand at the rear table - nice touch.', '2012-04-22 12:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748744, 1009823, 101256, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to be a boo bird as I believe that all entries should be given due consideration and a certain base level of critique, but I just don''t like this. Period. And my personal rating system calls for a minimum of a 5 just for entering the challenges so I''m afraid that''s what I''m going to give.  Sorry - differing tastes I guess.</td>', 'I don''t want to be a boo bird as I believe that all entries should be given due consideration and a certain base level of critique, but I just don''t like this. Period. And my personal rating system calls for a minimum of a 5 just for entering the challenges so I''m afraid that''s what I''m going to give.  Sorry - differing tastes I guess.', '2012-04-22 12:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748745, 1010820, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever and another example of great editing skills. The overall all green cast to the image is also a plus in my opinion. Nicely done - top ten image.</td>', 'Clever and another example of great editing skills. The overall all green cast to the image is also a plus in my opinion. Nicely done - top ten image.', '2012-04-22 12:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748747, 1010954, 101256, '<td valign="top">Escape from what?  The SFx just don''t work for me. Don''t mean to be a boo bird, but I can''t understand what the context is. The technique is interesting, but I don''t think it adds much to the image.</td>', 'Escape from what?  The SFx just don''t work for me. Don''t mean to be a boo bird, but I can''t understand what the context is. The technique is interesting, but I don''t think it adds much to the image.', '2012-04-22 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748748, 1010584, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes these motion shots work and sometimes they don''t.  Again, just my opinion, but I think this could have been thought through to produce something better than what is shown.</td>', 'Sometimes these motion shots work and sometimes they don''t.  Again, just my opinion, but I think this could have been thought through to produce something better than what is shown.', '2012-04-22 12:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748749, 1010743, 101256, '<td valign="top">Every EMT has a pet "thing" that gives them the heebie jeebies.  Fingers are mine.  :&gt;)  A great piece of editing and a little dark humor to go with it. Nicely done - a top five image for sure.</td>', 'Every EMT has a pet "thing" that gives them the heebie jeebies.  Fingers are mine.  :>)  A great piece of editing and a little dark humor to go with it. Nicely done - a top five image for sure.', '2012-04-22 12:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748753, 1010854, 101256, '<td valign="top">Is this one of those "Lost" homages? I just watched "Madagascar II" where the little old Jewish lady gets lost on the African plains and this reminds me of that. A little too much space in the image for my taste, but otherwise very competent technically.  Composition needs some work.</td>', 'Is this one of those "Lost" homages? I just watched "Madagascar II" where the little old Jewish lady gets lost on the African plains and this reminds me of that. A little too much space in the image for my taste, but otherwise very competent technically.  Composition needs some work.', '2012-04-22 12:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748754, 1010105, 101256, '<td valign="top">All the little red pixels and red spots are annoying. A little more thought would have done this image justice.</td>', 'All the little red pixels and red spots are annoying. A little more thought would have done this image justice.', '2012-04-22 12:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748756, 1010940, 101256, '<td valign="top">Heh. I''m not a huge fan of black and white with color, but this works for me. Clever composition - well done.</td>', 'Heh. I''m not a huge fan of black and white with color, but this works for me. Clever composition - well done.', '2012-04-22 12:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748758, 1010125, 101256, '<td valign="top">Yes - yes it does and this is a good example of it. A simple image that conveys the thought perfectly.  Very nice.</td>', 'Yes - yes it does and this is a good example of it. A simple image that conveys the thought perfectly.  Very nice.', '2012-04-22 12:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748760, 1010113, 101256, '<td valign="top">Over driving the image is difficult to judge to me because in my opinion, it slightly changes the image from "photograph" to "art". Again, just my opinion. Still, it is nicely done and composed.  That''s gotta hurt. :&gt;)</td>', 'Over driving the image is difficult to judge to me because in my opinion, it slightly changes the image from "photograph" to "art". Again, just my opinion. Still, it is nicely done and composed.  That''s gotta hurt. :>)', '2012-04-22 12:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748765, 1010848, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is something wrong with the hand and I can''t figure out what it is. It is distracting me from really giving a 10. After staring at this for five minutes (and getting the blue cast out of my retinas), I figured it out. The blue is over driven which gives the palm of the hand a spotty appearance and makes the fingers look like sausages. Plus the skin folds in the fingers look distorted and in one case, gone entirely. Still, I like it so a 9 it is.</td>', 'There is something wrong with the hand and I can''t figure out what it is. It is distracting me from really giving a 10. After staring at this for five minutes (and getting the blue cast out of my retinas), I figured it out. The blue is over driven which gives the palm of the hand a spotty appearance and makes the fingers look like sausages. Plus the skin folds in the fingers look distorted and in one case, gone entirely. Still, I like it so a 9 it is.', '2012-04-22 12:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748766, 1010956, 101256, '<td valign="top">That''s a funny idea - I like funny. High marks for being humorous.  Not to mention a decent job editing.  Well done.</td>', 'That''s a funny idea - I like funny. High marks for being humorous.  Not to mention a decent job editing.  Well done.', '2012-04-22 12:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748773, 1010908, 101256, '<td valign="top">I have been interested for a long time in the fine line between "art" and photography - meaning that point to where a photograph is manipulated that it has the look and feel of a painting (or pencil drawing in this case) but you can still tell it was a photograph. This is a stellar example of that particular technique of imagery. I''m giving this a 10 - well done.</td>', 'I have been interested for a long time in the fine line between "art" and photography - meaning that point to where a photograph is manipulated that it has the look and feel of a painting (or pencil drawing in this case) but you can still tell it was a photograph. This is a stellar example of that particular technique of imagery. I''m giving this a 10 - well done.', '2012-04-22 12:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748775, 1010974, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the point - I don''t get it. I''m not at all sure what this is about and how it relates to emergencies. Still, it is an entry and worthy of evaluation so - I think the image is a little grainy and the colors are much softer than they should be to have any sort of aesthetic impact.</td>', 'I''m missing the point - I don''t get it. I''m not at all sure what this is about and how it relates to emergencies. Still, it is an entry and worthy of evaluation so - I think the image is a little grainy and the colors are much softer than they should be to have any sort of aesthetic impact.', '2012-04-22 13:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6748782, 1010927, 101256, '<td valign="top">There are two ways to look at this.  One is acceptance of it as it is - a very good, no make that excellent, manufactured Photoshop image combining elements and creating a painting like impression.  The other way is to really hit this hard because it just doesn''t look like a real photograph, more like a painting which would more properly belong in a wholly different category other than "photograph". I honestly don''t know what to do or how to rate it. My default position is give credit where credit is due and give this a ten just for the sheer ability and skill used in developing the image. I need to think about this and look at the remaining images before I rate it - comparison can sometimes help develop an opinion.<br/> <br/><b>UPDATE:</b> Well, this is clearly the class of the field in terms of editing skills.  It also is the class of the field in terms of composition - the high drama is evident. Minor technical issue in that the two choppers would not be working that close together [sorry - former USAF Air Rescue (CSAR)], but that''s not the point.  I''m just not convinced that this qualifies as a "photograph".  But that''s really the point isn''t it?  You''re depicting an emergency situation using photographic elements to make a coherent composition. However, there doesn''t seem to be a dispute with regard to that issue so I''m giving credit where credit is due.  Well done - I''m rating it a ten.  Should win the contest.</td>', 'There are two ways to look at this.  One is acceptance of it as it is - a very good, no make that excellent, manufactured Photoshop image combining elements and creating a painting like impression.  The other way is to really hit this hard because it just doesn''t look like a real photograph, more like a painting which would more properly belong in a wholly different category other than "photograph". I honestly don''t know what to do or how to rate it. My default position is give credit where credit is due and give this a ten just for the sheer ability and skill used in developing the image. I need to think about this and look at the remaining images before I rate it - comparison can sometimes help develop an opinion. UPDATE: Well, this is clearly the class of the field in terms of editing skills.  It also is the class of the field in terms of composition - the high drama is evident. Minor technical issue in that the two choppers would not be working that close together [sorry - former USAF Air Rescue (CSAR)], but that''s not the point.  I''m just not convinced that this qualifies as a "photograph".  But that''s really the point isn''t it?  You''re depicting an emergency situation using photographic elements to make a coherent composition. However, there doesn''t seem to be a dispute with regard to that issue so I''m giving credit where credit is due.  Well done - I''m rating it a ten.  Should win the contest.', '2012-04-22 13:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
