(6750272, 1010939, 128323, '<td valign="top">Cool black and white.  I like the enthusiastic heimlich-giver on the right.  it''s always good to give a thumbs-up before saving a choking person :)</td>', 'Cool black and white.  I like the enthusiastic heimlich-giver on the right.  it''s always good to give a thumbs-up before saving a choking person :)', '2012-04-24 09:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6750273, 1010828, 128323, '<td valign="top">Ha... been there.  Brawny paper towels just don''t do the trick, do they?</td>', 'Ha... been there.  Brawny paper towels just don''t do the trick, do they?', '2012-04-24 09:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6750276, 1010895, 128323, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a good shot if it were composed a little better.  There''s a tire there, which makes you wonder if the subject were hit by a car, but there''s not enough of it in the frame to add to the composition.  The two people are also framed in awkwardly.</td>', 'I think this could have been a good shot if it were composed a little better.  There''s a tire there, which makes you wonder if the subject were hit by a car, but there''s not enough of it in the frame to add to the composition.  The two people are also framed in awkwardly.', '2012-04-24 09:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6750277, 1010836, 128323, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent editing and composition!  Too bad you couldn''t have put in a lot more blood, after all your femoral artery is wide open!  Great title too!<br/>9</td>', 'Wow, excellent editing and composition!  Too bad you couldn''t have put in a lot more blood, after all your femoral artery is wide open!  Great title too!9', '2012-04-24 09:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
