(6752865, 1010927, 69246, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic!<br/> <br/>Also, did you notice, you now have the <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/photo_browse.php?view=highestrated" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">4th highest scored photo</a>.<br/> <br/>Its been 5 years since one broke the top 5.<br/> <br/>#5 2007<br/>#4 Yours (2012)<br/>#3 2002<br/>#2 2002<br/>#1 2002<br/> <br/>ETA: Just noticed <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a> wrote that too.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-27 01:08:02.</i></td>', 'This is fantastic! Also, did you notice, you now have the 4th highest scored photo. Its been 5 years since one broke the top 5. #5 2007#4 Yours (2012)#3 2002#2 2002#1 2002 ETA: Just noticed  Neat wrote that too.', '2012-04-27 02:07:19.000000', '2012-04-27 02:08:02.000000', 0),
(6752866, 1010836, 96751, '<td valign="top">You DO look a LOT like our Ben in this image.  Congrats on the ribbon. ''tis but a flesh wound...</td>', 'You DO look a LOT like our Ben in this image.  Congrats on the ribbon. ''tis but a flesh wound...', '2012-04-27 02:07:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6752867, 1010943, 96751, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM, Judi.  Very powerful image.</td>', 'Congrats on the HM, Judi.  Very powerful image.', '2012-04-27 02:08:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6752868, 1010927, 103142, '<td valign="top">Oh my!!! Look at those 10s!! <br/> <br/>So incredible! Such a wonderful back story! Huge congrats!<br/> <br/>This is truly awesome. It may not be fantasy, it may not have philosophical meaning, but it''s a truly incredible piece.<br/> <br/>Regarding my comment about standing in the water -- my eyes aren''t the best (that''s why I over sharpen everything. :) When I look at it, I didn''t see someone on a log. When I look at it, the log looked like a person. The part that''s out of the water looks like a face to me with the body mostly submerged. So it looked like you were protecting another person. If that''s the case, you must be standing, because you wouldn''t float on a person. :)<br/> <br/>So much for my eyes. :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh my!!! Look at those 10s!!  So incredible! Such a wonderful back story! Huge congrats! This is truly awesome. It may not be fantasy, it may not have philosophical meaning, but it''s a truly incredible piece. Regarding my comment about standing in the water -- my eyes aren''t the best (that''s why I over sharpen everything. :) When I look at it, I didn''t see someone on a log. When I look at it, the log looked like a person. The part that''s out of the water looks like a face to me with the body mostly submerged. So it looked like you were protecting another person. If that''s the case, you must be standing, because you wouldn''t float on a person. :) So much for my eyes. :) ', '2012-04-27 02:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6752879, 1010956, 96751, '<td valign="top">Really well-achieved.   Congrats on the HM</td>', 'Really well-achieved.   Congrats on the HM', '2012-04-27 02:20:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6752880, 1010848, 6519, '<td valign="top">About this line: <i>"..I''d look stupid sharing all the details for a mediocre image. "</i> <br/> <br/>That is nonsense!<br/>6.28 is a very good score. The shot is great (had a 7 from me). <br/> <br/>I thank you for posting the set-up. I''m sure most, if not all, of us love reading/seeing how something was done and this is no exception.<br/> <br/>I thank you for the trouble and I enjoyed reading about it.</td>', 'About this line: "..I''d look stupid sharing all the details for a mediocre image. "  That is nonsense!6.28 is a very good score. The shot is great (had a 7 from me).  I thank you for posting the set-up. I''m sure most, if not all, of us love reading/seeing how something was done and this is no exception. I thank you for the trouble and I enjoyed reading about it.', '2012-04-27 02:21:52.000000', NULL, 0),
