(6752989, 1010927, 68956, '<td valign="top">It''s very well done, congratulations. I think if that was a real person in that water they wouldn''t be able to stay astride the log without it rolling, they''d have to cling on instead.Not that it matters!!</td>', 'It''s very well done, congratulations. I think if that was a real person in that water they wouldn''t be able to stay astride the log without it rolling, they''d have to cling on instead.Not that it matters!!', '2012-04-27 04:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
