(6753004, 1010927, 100393, '<td valign="top">Highest DPC score in the last 10 years - it''s fitting that it goes to you.<br/> <br/>I think people sometimes look at your PS work but forget about the amount of dedication you put into each of the shots and the overall project itself.<br/> <br/>I like some of your other composite work more than this one, but I''m really pleased to see an image from you in the all-time top images.<br/> <br/>I actually think you will beat this score - perhaps even very soon.<br/> <br/>Well done.</td>', 'Highest DPC score in the last 10 years - it''s fitting that it goes to you. I think people sometimes look at your PS work but forget about the amount of dedication you put into each of the shots and the overall project itself. I like some of your other composite work more than this one, but I''m really pleased to see an image from you in the all-time top images. I actually think you will beat this score - perhaps even very soon. Well done.', '2012-04-27 05:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753008, 1010927, 118154, '<td valign="top">Congratulations it just had to win,great stuff.</td>', 'Congratulations it just had to win,great stuff.', '2012-04-27 06:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
