(6753014, 1010927, 7889, '<td valign="top">Quality ! I am always impressed at how much time and effort you put into your work.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Quality ! I am always impressed at how much time and effort you put into your work. ', '2012-04-27 06:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753020, 1010927, 108580, '<td valign="top">Now this is in the spirit of the challenge. I understand your generally leaning toward more fantasy and perhaps you have "bent to the trend" in this instance but it shows how dedicated you are to this "new" calling of yours. Superb vision as always, and for me, my highest vote in this challenge. Un travail remarquable, bith sur le terrain et dans la chambre noire numérique, Cristophe.</td>', 'Now this is in the spirit of the challenge. I understand your generally leaning toward more fantasy and perhaps you have "bent to the trend" in this instance but it shows how dedicated you are to this "new" calling of yours. Superb vision as always, and for me, my highest vote in this challenge. Un travail remarquable, bith sur le terrain et dans la chambre noire numérique, Cristophe.', '2012-04-27 07:00:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753021, 1010743, 138174, '<td valign="top">the blood is a weird color</td>', 'the blood is a weird color', '2012-04-27 07:00:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753022, 1010892, 108580, '<td valign="top">Whatever you say about these circus clowns of yours they really are a hoot. Top marks.</td>', 'Whatever you say about these circus clowns of yours they really are a hoot. Top marks.', '2012-04-27 07:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753024, 1010836, 108580, '<td valign="top">As Monty Python would say in an Octogenarian wavering, faltering voice "I''m not dead yet"<br/>Well done on the idea and excellent processing and humour. Top Marks.</td>', 'As Monty Python would say in an Octogenarian wavering, faltering voice "I''m not dead yet"Well done on the idea and excellent processing and humour. Top Marks.', '2012-04-27 07:03:56.000000', NULL, 0),
