(6753057, 1010940, 109227, '<td valign="top">I love this one; usually not a fan of desat, but it works well here.  Should have been higher, but a lot of competition, still top 10 not bad.</td>', 'I love this one; usually not a fan of desat, but it works well here.  Should have been higher, but a lot of competition, still top 10 not bad.', '2012-04-27 08:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
