(6753109, 1010927, 22459, '<td valign="top">The score says it all....congrats Christophe! I''m sure you will beat this score such is your dedication and skill level.<br/></td>', 'The score says it all....congrats Christophe! I''m sure you will beat this score such is your dedication and skill level.', '2012-04-27 09:37:36.000000', NULL, 0),
