(6753147, 1010927, 146356, '<td valign="top">This is very impressive. Just when i begin to think my skills are approaching intermediate, i feel like a beginner again and its an awesome .. bittersweet feeling.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-04-27 09:32:12.</i></td>', 'This is very impressive. Just when i begin to think my skills are approaching intermediate, i feel like a beginner again and its an awesome .. bittersweet feeling.', '2012-04-27 10:30:05.000000', '2012-04-27 10:32:12.000000', 0),
(6753153, 1010836, 65319, '<td valign="top">Oh...and here I thought you were Ben!  I guess I should cancel that pedicure appointment. Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'Oh...and here I thought you were Ben!  I guess I should cancel that pedicure appointment. Congrats on your ribbon!', '2012-04-27 10:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753155, 1010892, 146356, '<td valign="top">You''ve really took my narrow assesment of what can be done with squirrels and expanded it incredibly. I''ve come to believe its not about the squirrel, but the Wendy behind it.</td>', 'You''ve really took my narrow assesment of what can be done with squirrels and expanded it incredibly. I''ve come to believe its not about the squirrel, but the Wendy behind it.', '2012-04-27 10:41:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753159, 1010927, 59029, '<td valign="top">Lovely work and yep, I know a few people who would also throw themselves between their camera and danger!  Great job and congrats on the blue! :-)</td>', 'Lovely work and yep, I know a few people who would also throw themselves between their camera and danger!  Great job and congrats on the blue! :-)', '2012-04-27 10:49:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753161, 1010956, 61396, '<td valign="top">Psst, Dennis. It''s right behind you!<br/> <br/>As a coffee freak you are going to enjoy your Italy tour (but be warned - you might never appreciate SB as much when you are back).</td>', 'Psst, Dennis. It''s right behind you! As a coffee freak you are going to enjoy your Italy tour (but be warned - you might never appreciate SB as much when you are back).', '2012-04-27 10:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753162, 1010892, 59029, '<td valign="top">Yep, confirms what I always knew...squirrels are revolting ;-) Great job Wendy and congrats on the red!</td>', 'Yep, confirms what I always knew...squirrels are revolting ;-) Great job Wendy and congrats on the red!', '2012-04-27 10:51:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753164, 1010836, 59029, '<td valign="top">Oh gawd that is just too funny, does highlight everyone''s reliance on the interwebz these days...congrats on the yellow!</td>', 'Oh gawd that is just too funny, does highlight everyone''s reliance on the interwebz these days...congrats on the yellow!', '2012-04-27 10:53:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753167, 1010743, 59029, '<td valign="top">Ewwww!!! Lol!  I guess the blood looks a teeny bit off due to the wb, but in that case I feel it adds to the realism.  Yucky!</td>', 'Ewwww!!! Lol!  I guess the blood looks a teeny bit off due to the wb, but in that case I feel it adds to the realism.  Yucky!', '2012-04-27 10:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753168, 1010836, 18563, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments and votes everyone! <br/> <br/>I''m not sure if I know Ben but I will definitely take the pedicure advice and maybe even trim up those sasquatch legs of mine ;) <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments and votes everyone!  I''m not sure if I know Ben but I will definitely take the pedicure advice and maybe even trim up those sasquatch legs of mine ;)  ', '2012-04-27 10:56:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753171, 1010927, 96530, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Christophe! Your figure in the water seems lacking compared to some of your other work (still ten times better than I could do) but other parts of this image are brilliant. Love the glow of the helicopters!<br/>Sometimes the best shots put your camera at risk. I took a trip to the coast myself last month and almost lost my camera to the water too- three times!  :P</td>', 'Congratulations Christophe! Your figure in the water seems lacking compared to some of your other work (still ten times better than I could do) but other parts of this image are brilliant. Love the glow of the helicopters!Sometimes the best shots put your camera at risk. I took a trip to the coast myself last month and almost lost my camera to the water too- three times!  :P', '2012-04-27 11:06:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753191, 1010892, 61222, '<td valign="top">Congrats Wendy!! Great job on this and so very cool.</td>', 'Congrats Wendy!! Great job on this and so very cool.', '2012-04-27 11:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753196, 1010848, 137091, '<td valign="top">Being a noob photographer I love it when others with more experiance share their steps!  Helps me understand :)<br/>Thanks!</td>', 'Being a noob photographer I love it when others with more experiance share their steps!  Helps me understand :)Thanks!', '2012-04-27 11:59:54.000000', NULL, 0),
