(6753255, 1010927, 137576, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by paulbtlw:</b></div><hr/><i> Highest DPC score in the last 10 years - it''s fitting that it goes to you.<br/> <br/>I think people sometimes look at your PS work but forget about the amount of dedication you put into each of the shots and the overall project itself.<br/> <br/>I like some of your other composite work more than this one, but I''m really pleased to see an image from you in the all-time top images.<br/> <br/>I actually think you will beat this score - perhaps even very soon.<br/> <br/>Well done. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i was actually hoping he''d get the all time score, its a poor reflection on this site that the top rated image even if its teh site creator is an average at best shot, (submitted today it would struggle to pull a 4.8-5) i know voters have got a lot harsher which is a shame, so many great photos on this site.</td>', 'Originally posted by paulbtlw: Highest DPC score in the last 10 years - it''s fitting that it goes to you. I think people sometimes look at your PS work but forget about the amount of dedication you put into each of the shots and the overall project itself. I like some of your other composite work more than this one, but I''m really pleased to see an image from you in the all-time top images. I actually think you will beat this score - perhaps even very soon. Well done.   i was actually hoping he''d get the all time score, its a poor reflection on this site that the top rated image even if its teh site creator is an average at best shot, (submitted today it would struggle to pull a 4.8-5) i know voters have got a lot harsher which is a shame, so many great photos on this site.', '2012-04-27 14:34:16.000000', NULL, 0),
