(6753378, 1010927, 32849, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the point of all the sucking up taking place. <br/> <br/>This picture is photoshopped. Regardless of how much technical photography skill was put in place, it was all lost when extensive photoshopping and external objects were put on the photo. <br/> <br/>Yes it may be artistic, but to me... this seems like amateur digital art. There is much better work on deviant art. <br/> <br/>I haven''t been here in a long long time, I recall back in the old days this website would restrict the extensive use of photoshop. I remember there was some rules about photos only having minor touch ups accepted. where did this rule go away? <br/> <br/>am I missing something? or is this website just dying?</td>', 'I don''t understand the point of all the sucking up taking place.  This picture is photoshopped. Regardless of how much technical photography skill was put in place, it was all lost when extensive photoshopping and external objects were put on the photo.  Yes it may be artistic, but to me... this seems like amateur digital art. There is much better work on deviant art.  I haven''t been here in a long long time, I recall back in the old days this website would restrict the extensive use of photoshop. I remember there was some rules about photos only having minor touch ups accepted. where did this rule go away?  am I missing something? or is this website just dying?', '2012-04-27 18:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6753381, 1010927, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by darkfact:</b></div><hr/><i>am I missing something? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Obviously, yes. The challenges on this website are run under different rules sets, and this one allowed extensive post-processing. RTFM.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by darkfact:am I missing something?   Obviously, yes. The challenges on this website are run under different rules sets, and this one allowed extensive post-processing. RTFM.', '2012-04-27 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
