(6754903, 1010927, 140305, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I had to laugh as you described your story about being knocked over by a wave. The same thing happened to me on vacation recently. I''m glad to say I was able to periscope mine out of the water as well. My friends were laughing at me as I scrambled up on the beach looking like a drowned rat! I can laugh now too, but that day it was a little scary (all about the camera). Anyways, congratulations on a fantastic image. You never fail to amaze.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I had to laugh as you described your story about being knocked over by a wave. The same thing happened to me on vacation recently. I''m glad to say I was able to periscope mine out of the water as well. My friends were laughing at me as I scrambled up on the beach looking like a drowned rat! I can laugh now too, but that day it was a little scary (all about the camera). Anyways, congratulations on a fantastic image. You never fail to amaze.', '2012-04-30 00:04:36.000000', NULL, 0),
